        "title": "Limit alternatives",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "不是…就是 restricts the possibilities to the named alternatives. It differs from 不是…而是, which rejects one claim and corrects it.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他不是在家，就是在学校。",
                "pinyin": "tā bùshì zài jiā ， jiùshì zài xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "He is either at home or at school.",
                "audio": "44d59dfd1c8ddd15efae07a96b3800cc82d35aa38d2efb9fa02844d73d316fd6"
              },
              {
                "text": "这不是茶，而是水。",
                "pinyin": "zhè bùshì chá ， érshì shuǐ 。",
                "meaning": "This is not tea but water.",
